  "name": "Creamy Waldorf Salad",
  "subtitle": "A crisp fruit-and-celery salad with creamy dressing",
  "description": "Apples, grapes, raisins, celery, and walnuts are folded with whipped cream, mayonnaise, lemon, and nutmeg, then chilled before serving.",
